      "message": "**Location:** `util/egis/ec_comm.cc` (`EcCommand::UpdateChecksum`)\n\n**The Problem:** You are manually indexing `buf[1]` to inject the checksum.\n\n```c\n  uint8_t *buf \u003d cmd_bytes_.data();\n  buf[1] \u003d 0;\n  for (size_t i \u003d 0; i \u003c cmd_bytes_.size(); i++) sum +\u003d buf[i];\n  buf[1] \u003d (256 - (sum % 256)) % 256;\n\n```\n\n**The Fix:** Tie it directly to the protocol struct using `offsetof`, which makes it explicitly clear *why* you are mutating that specific byte.\n\n```c\n  uint8_t *buf \u003d cmd_bytes_.data();\n  const size_t csum_offset \u003d offsetof(EcHostCommandRequest, checksum);\n  \n  buf[csum_offset] \u003d 0;\n  for (size_t i \u003d 0; i \u003c cmd_bytes_.size(); i++) {\n    sum +\u003d buf[i];\n  }\n  buf[csum_offset] \u003d static_cast\u003cuint8_t\u003e((256 - (sum % 256)) % 256);\n\n```",
